# ========================================
# NOTES:
# ========================================
# 1. EMAIL_USER, EMAIL_PASSWORD, dan EMAIL_ADMIN adalah REQUIRED untuk fitur contact form
# 2. Jangan commit file .env ke repository, hanya .env.example
# 3. Untuk production, gunakan environment variables dari hosting provider
# 4. Sensitive data (passwords, keys) harus disimpan di secret management
# 5. Backup konfigurasi penting di secure location
# 6. Anti-spam aktif secara default: max 3 email per jam per alamat email